{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o044b","title":"徐晃佯断后取偃城曹操增十二营","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o044b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"徐晃佯断后取偃城曹操增十二营","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"进军","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"增援","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0038","role":"赴援","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0039","role":"赴援","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"樊襄被围时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o044b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o044b-q","source_order":[17,169,"O044b"],"order":3594}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0039","name":"朱盖","evidence":["zhangle-q-o044"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o044-zhangle-p0039","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o044"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o044b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c20aa407eaa949f0a2f7","layer":"original","quote":"贼屯偃城〖3〗。晃到，诡道作都堑〖4〗，示欲截其后；贼烧屯走。晃得偃城，两面连营；稍前，去贼围三丈所。未攻，太祖前后遣殷署、朱盖等，凡十二营，诣晃。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":100,"end":174},{"id":"zhangle-q-o044","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c20aa407eaa949f0a2f7","layer":"original","quote":"复遣晃助曹仁讨关羽，屯宛。会汉水暴溢，于禁等没。羽围仁于樊，又围将军吕常于襄阳。晃所将多新卒，以羽难与争锋，遂前，至阳陵陂屯〖1〗。太祖复还遣将军徐商、吕建等诣晃〖2〗，令曰：“须兵马集至，乃俱前。”贼屯偃城〖3〗。晃到，诡道作都堑〖4〗，示欲截其后；贼烧屯走。晃得偃城，两面连营；稍前，去贼围三丈所。未攻，太祖前后遣殷署、朱盖等，凡十二营，诣晃。贼围头有屯〖5〗，又别屯四冢〖6〗。晃扬声当攻围头屯，而密攻四冢。羽见四冢欲坏，自将步骑五千出战。晃击之，退走；遂追陷与俱入围，破之：或自投沔水死。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":248}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
